        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in introducing this fantastic 3-bedroom semi-detached family home with a sunny south facing rear garden to the market ideally located within the quaint cul de sac of Ellensborough Park, Kiltipper. \r\n\r\nEllensborough ever in demand, is enviably positioned within arm's reach of all essential amenities including esteemed primary & secondary schools, extensive leisure & sports facilities, convenience stores & The Square Shopping Centre, along with Ellensborough Lawn positioned right beside a Greenway with access to Bohernabreena reservoir walkway. On a transport note, bus routes are plentiful and the M50 Motorway is found within minutes by car. \r\n \r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 104 sqm in brief compromises of entrance hallway with guest bathroom, living room with fireplace and bay window, fully fitted kitchen and separate dining room to the rear. On the first floor you will find three generous bedrooms with built in wardrobes (one master ensuite) and the main family bathroom. \r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed private garden which comes of the lowest maintenance with a highly sought after south facing orientation making it the perfect sun trap on them long sunny summer evenings. The front provides ample off-street parking on a beautiful cul de sac with virtually no passing traffic and further benefitted by overlooking a large green area. \r\n\r\nNo. 49 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners, it has been recently painted from top to bottom with fresh new carpet on the stairs & landing. It has plenty of additional features such as extra spacious living, fully fitted kitchen, gas fired central heating with combi-boiler, top quality fixtures & fittings and tasteful décor to name but a few. \r\n\r\nThis wonderful home offers a great opportunity for a wide range of buyers looking to settle roots in one of Dublin 24s most sought-after areas.\r\n\r\nPlease contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to arrange a viewing here as this one shouldn't be missed! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 104 sqm \r\n- BER C \r\n- 3 bed / 3 bath \r\n- Semi-detached family home \r\n- Great condition throughout \r\n- Recently renovated throughout \r\n- Generous living space \r\n- Entrance hall with guest bathroom\r\n- Large living room with fireplace \r\n- Bay window in living room \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Separate dining room to rear \r\n- Three generous bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Master bedroom ensuite \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- New gas combi-boiler \r\n- Ample storage space \r\n- Low maintenance rear garden \r\n- South facing orientation \r\n- Private & fully enclosed \r\n- Ample parking to the front \r\n- Peaceful cul de sac setting\r\n- Overlooking large green area \r\n- Right at the foot of the Dublin Mountains \r\n- Exclusive and highly sought-after development \r\n- The ideal family home \r\n\r\nDirections - D24 N2E0"
      },
